package(USEPKG Larmor G4GeoLokiTests G4GeoLoki G4CustomPyGen G4Launcher GriffAnaUtils Units)

######################################################################

Regression tests (test-only package) of the Larmor setups (package Larmor): they pin
the Larmor 2020 and 2022 geometries, the frozen bank placement and pixel logic of
the Larmor 2022 experiment (Larmor2022Bank), and check the built geometry against
the pixel logic (navigation, geantino aiming). Uses the helpers of G4GeoLokiTests.

Run with: sb -t --testfilter='sb_larmortests_*'

Primary author: milan.klausz@ess.eu
